{%- comment -%}
  Free-shipping nudge under the buy box (Sept 2026 audit).
  Reuses the cart's threshold math: what the cart total would be after adding
  this variant versus settings.free_shipping_threshold. The cart already says
  "You're $3 away" — this surfaces the same fact one step earlier, where the
  shopper can still add a second piece before checkout.
  Renders nothing when the threshold is 0. Accepts: variant.
  Server-rendered from the first available variant; the drawer's live bar
  remains the source of truth once the item is in the cart.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign nudge_threshold = settings.free_shipping_threshold | times: 100
  assign nudge_remaining = 0
  if nudge_threshold > 0 and variant != blank
    assign nudge_total = cart.total_price | plus: variant.price
    assign nudge_remaining = nudge_threshold | minus: nudge_total
  endif
-%}
{%- if nudge_threshold > 0 and variant != blank -%}
  <p class="pdp__shipnudge" data-ship-nudge>
    {%- if nudge_remaining > 0 -%}
      Add <strong>{{ nudge_remaining | money }}</strong> more and your order ships free in the US.
    {%- else -%}
      <strong>Ships free.</strong> This order clears the {{ nudge_threshold | money_without_trailing_zeros }} free-shipping threshold.
    {%- endif -%}
  </p>
{%- endif -%}
